<section id="associations" data-aos="fade-up">
    <h1>Professional Associations</h1>
    <p>I follow or plan to join several professional organizations that align with my career goals in data science:</p>

    <div class="association" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
        <h2>Association for Computing Machinery (ACM)</h2>
        <p>ACM is the largest and most respected computing societies in the world. It provides access to conferences and professional development resources in areas like AI, software engineering, and data science, all fields I'm have interest in.</p>
        <a href="https://www.acm.org/" target="_blank">Visit ACM</a>
    </div>

    <div class="association" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
        <h2>Institute for Operations Research and the Management Sciences (INFORMS)</h2>
        <p>INFORMS is a vibrant community of data science, analytics, and operations research professionals.</p>
        <a href="https://www.informs.org/" target="_blank">Visit INFORMS</a>
    </div>

    <div class="association" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
        <h2>Data Management Association (DAMA)</h2>
        <p>DAMA is a global not-for-profit organization which aims to advance concepts and practices about information management and data management.</p>
        <a href="https://dama.org/" target="_blank">Visit DAMA</a>
    </div>

    <div class="association" data-aos="zoom-in-up">
        <h2>IEEE Computer Society</h2>
        <p>The IEEE Computer Society is a global organization for computing professionals. It offers certifications, publications, and learning opportunities in emerging technologies.</p>
        <a href="https://www.computer.org/" target="_blank">Visit IEEE CS</a>
    </div>
</section>
